{"meta":{"id":"fe4e5da7-dcc7-4e73-943b-c074edbdda37","publication_id":"30c7e4c1-15ed-46d8-a23d-32c90e011794","web_title":"Cómo los hackatones unen talento, cooperativas y propósito","parameterized_web_title":"como-los-hackatones-unen-talento-cooperativas-y-proposito","utm_params_enabled":true,"utm_campaign":"como-los-hackatones-unen-talento-cooperativas-y-proposito","utm_medium":"referral","utm_source":"blog.telluscoop.com","web_subtitle":"De ir a una hackatón solo a construir comunidad desde dentro del ecosistema Web3","web_audiences":"free","status":"published","active":true,"featured":false,"override_scheduled_at":"2025-12-16T11:30:29.529Z","slug":"c-mo-los-hackatones-unen-talento-cooperativas-y-prop-sito","is_premium":false,"image_url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/asset/file/93d9d938-c331-494c-9a5d-0d03637331f0/IMG_20251122_140200741_HDR.jpg?t=1764356920","image_width":1920,"image_height":1440,"meta_default_title":"Cómo los hackatones unen talento, cooperativas y propósito","meta_default_description":"De ir a una hackatón solo a construir comunidad desde dentro del ecosistema Web3","meta_og_title":"Cómo los hackatones unen talento, cooperativas y propósito","meta_og_description":"De ir a una hackatón solo a construir comunidad desde dentro del ecosistema Web3","meta_twitter_title":"Cómo los hackatones unen talento, cooperativas y propósito","meta_twitter_description":"De ir a una hackatón solo a construir comunidad desde dentro del ecosistema Web3","audience":"free","comments_enabled":true,"comments_state":"default","enforce_gated_content":true,"enable_popup_on_scroll":false,"email_capture_title":"Suscríbete para seguir leyendo","email_capture_message":"Este contenido es gratuito, pero debes estar suscrito a Tellus Cooperative para continuar leyendo.","email_capture_cta":"Suscríbete","estimated_reading_time":4,"estimated_reading_time_display":"4 minutos","paywall_id":null,"authors":[{"id":"c1542eb2-b73f-48c5-8990-0d6f3f54b24d","name":"Marcos Vinicio Reyes Muñoz","profile_picture":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/c1542eb2-b73f-48c5-8990-0d6f3f54b24d/ChatGPT_Image_11_feb_2026__04_29_30_p.m..png","thumb":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/c1542eb2-b73f-48c5-8990-0d6f3f54b24d/thumb_ChatGPT_Image_11_feb_2026__04_29_30_p.m..png"},"landscape":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/c1542eb2-b73f-48c5-8990-0d6f3f54b24d/landscape_ChatGPT_Image_11_feb_2026__04_29_30_p.m..png"}},"bio":null,"twitter_handle":"httpsxcomblakyto","facebook_url":"","instagram_url":"https://www.instagram.com/marcosvinicioreyes","linkedin_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/marcosvinicioreyes/","tiktok_url":null,"youtube_url":null,"discord_url":"vinicioreyes","bluesky_url":null}],"content_tags":[{"id":"908b47e8-0ab1-4e65-bfb0-58e59d474edd","display":"Community Writers","slug":"community-writers"}],"created_at":"2025-11-28T18:58:46Z","updated_at":"2025-12-16T11:30:48Z","html":null,"hide_premium_post":false,"contains_subscriber_break":false,"is_accessible_for_free":true,"paywall_shown":false,"metered_usage_shown":false,"metered_viewed_count":null,"force_premium":false,"enforce_paywall_breaks":true,"display_thumbnail_on_web":true,"display_title_on_web":true,"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"c1542eb2-b73f-48c5-8990-0d6f3f54b24d":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/marcos-vinicio-reyes-munoz"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div id=\"el-punto-de-partida-ir-solo-pero-no\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🌱</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> El punto de partida: ir solo, pero no estar solo</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">La primera hackatón a la que fui, fui solo.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Conocía a algunas personas del ecosistema, sí, pero no llegué con un equipo ni con algo planificado. Fui con curiosidad, ganas de aprender y la motivación de construir algo desde cero.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Y aun así, esa experiencia me dejó una frase marcada:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx90\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx93\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-quote _1xtprv91\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"_1xtprv92\">❝</div><div class=\"_1xtprv90\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Cuando entras a un hackatón, aunque conozcas a algunos, la verdadera magia está en cómo se abre la comunidad.</strong></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"de-desconocidos-a-equipo-cmo-se-for\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🤝</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> De desconocidos a equipo: cómo se forma una tribu sin planearla</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Meses después, en la Hackatón de Bendita IA, la historia fue distinta.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Esta vez llegué con un equipo que </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>no estaba previsto</em></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Nos encontramos en un taller previo, compartimos ideas, conversamos de Web3, nos reímos, detectamos habilidades distintas pero complementarias… y de forma muy orgánica decidimos participar juntos.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Sin estructuras, sin jerarquías, sin planificación.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Solo afinidad y propósito.</strong></span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx90\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx93\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-quote _1xtprv91\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"_1xtprv92\">❝</div><div class=\"_1xtprv90\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Las comunidades no se diseñan: </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>se encuentran</em></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"el-valor-invisible-de-los-hackatone\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">💡</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> El valor invisible de los hackatones</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Los hackatones no son solo código, velocidad o un pitch final.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Lo realmente valioso ocurre </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>entre medio</em></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">La mezcla de habilidades.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">La colaboración espontánea.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Las conversaciones que abren puertas.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">La energía de querer crear algo que importe.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Ahí es donde nace la comunidad.</strong></span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-imageBlock _2fealp0\" style=\"--caption-alignment:center\"><div class=\"_2fealp1\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 360px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=720,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/93d9d938-c331-494c-9a5d-0d03637331f0/IMG_20251122_140200741_HDR.jpg?t=1764356889 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 360px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=360,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/93d9d938-c331-494c-9a5d-0d03637331f0/IMG_20251122_140200741_HDR.jpg?t=1764356889 1x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=860,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/93d9d938-c331-494c-9a5d-0d03637331f0/IMG_20251122_140200741_HDR.jpg?t=1764356889 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=430,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/93d9d938-c331-494c-9a5d-0d03637331f0/IMG_20251122_140200741_HDR.jpg?t=1764356889 1x\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/93d9d938-c331-494c-9a5d-0d03637331f0/IMG_20251122_140200741_HDR.jpg?t=1764356889\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1440\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:0px;aspect-ratio:1920 / 1440;height:auto\" class=\"_2fealp2 _2fealp5\"></picture></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"llevar-web-3-a-un-espacio-web-2-sin\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🔗</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Llevar Web3 a un espacio Web2 (sin evangelizar)</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">La hackatón era Web2.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Nuestro equipo, Web3.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Y sin proponérnoslo, fuimos agregando ese “condimento Web3” a cada conversación:</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">blockchain, contratos inteligentes, cooperativismo, impacto.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Explicamos en simple, sin tecnicismos, sin imponer.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Y descubrimos que sí hay interés, pero falta aterrizaje.</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx90\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx93\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-quote _1xtprv91\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"_1xtprv92\">❝</div><div class=\"_1xtprv90\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Quienes construimos Web3 desde dentro tenemos la responsabilidad de explicarlo </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>en simple</em></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, no de complicarlo.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"por-qu-esto-conecta-tanto-con-tellu\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🧩</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> ¿Por qué esto conecta tanto con Tellus?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Porque Tellus funciona igual que un buen hackatón:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">personas distintas,</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">habilidades distintas,</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">propósitos compartidos,</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">apoyo genuino,</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">colaboración sin ego,</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">ganas de ver crecer los proyectos de los demás.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Tellus no es solo Web3.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Es </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>cooperación real</em></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Y los hackatones son una versión concentrada de esa misma cultura.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-imageBlock _2fealp0\" style=\"--caption-alignment:center\"><div class=\"_2fealp1\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 360px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=720,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/e7f82c13-2bda-443a-9ee0-b99f46f6a814/IMG_20251122_145814758_HDR_AE.jpg?t=1764356931 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 360px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=360,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/e7f82c13-2bda-443a-9ee0-b99f46f6a814/IMG_20251122_145814758_HDR_AE.jpg?t=1764356931 1x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=860,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/e7f82c13-2bda-443a-9ee0-b99f46f6a814/IMG_20251122_145814758_HDR_AE.jpg?t=1764356931 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=430,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/e7f82c13-2bda-443a-9ee0-b99f46f6a814/IMG_20251122_145814758_HDR_AE.jpg?t=1764356931 1x\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/e7f82c13-2bda-443a-9ee0-b99f46f6a814/IMG_20251122_145814758_HDR_AE.jpg?t=1764356931\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"863\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:0px;aspect-ratio:1920 / 863;height:auto\" class=\"_2fealp2 _2fealp5\"></picture></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"lo-que-aprend-y-te-puede-servir-aun\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">📝</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Lo que aprendí (y te puede servir aunque nunca vayas a un hackatón)</span></h2></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Compartir lo que sabes genera comunidad.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El propósito une más que cualquier stack tecnológico.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Los mejores equipos nacen por afinidad, no por diseño.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Web3 es profundamente humano.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Las cooperativas funcionan porque ponen a las personas al centro.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"cierre-construir-futuro-juntos\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🌟</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> Cierre: construir futuro, juntos</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si Web3 te parece complejo o lejano, quédate con esto:</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">No necesitas saberlo todo para ser parte.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Solo necesitas curiosidad y ganas de colaborar.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En Tellus somos una comunidad que acompaña, apoya y construye proyectos con propósito.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Hackatones como la de Bendita IA o las Web3 en las que participo son prueba de que </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>cuando la comunidad aparece, aparece el propósito.</strong></span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Y cuando aparece el propósito, </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>todo fluye</em></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-imageBlock _2fealp0\" style=\"--caption-alignment:center\"><div class=\"_2fealp1\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 360px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=720,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/738b3471-db6e-49c9-a32f-213b5c909351/IMG_20251122_085456656_HDR.jpg?t=1764356963 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 360px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=360,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/738b3471-db6e-49c9-a32f-213b5c909351/IMG_20251122_085456656_HDR.jpg?t=1764356963 1x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=860,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/738b3471-db6e-49c9-a32f-213b5c909351/IMG_20251122_085456656_HDR.jpg?t=1764356963 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=430,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/738b3471-db6e-49c9-a32f-213b5c909351/IMG_20251122_085456656_HDR.jpg?t=1764356963 1x\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/738b3471-db6e-49c9-a32f-213b5c909351/IMG_20251122_085456656_HDR.jpg?t=1764356963\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1440\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:0px;aspect-ratio:1920 / 1440;height:auto\" class=\"_2fealp2 _2fealp5\"></picture></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"quieres-aprender-de-web-3-cooperati\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">💬</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> ¿Quieres aprender de Web3, cooperativas o hackatones?</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Estoy siempre más que disponible para conversar.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Gracias por leer </span><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🙌</span></p></div></div>","publication":{"name":"Tellus Cooperative","description":"La Cooperativa Blockchain de LatAm","url":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/","twitter_url":"https://x.com/telluscoop","instagram_url":"https://instagram.com/telluscoop","linkedin_url":"https://linkedin.com/company/Tellus-Cooperative","youtube_url":"https://youtube.com/@telluscoop","discord_url":"https://discord.gg/V4eSGWA3PK"}}